        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "So happy I met Alexandra Blach, she very quickly helped me take the confusion out of making healthy choices. She helped me make attainable nutrition goals in order to improve my diet for overall health. I enjoyed her positive and encouraging style.",
