        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I am very happy with my appointments with Alexandra Blach, she has been very professional and supportive. I have been able to make excellent progress towards my goals in the 4 weeks we have been working together.\n\nThe method is great, it focuses on sustainable changes backed by information, easy-to-use tools, and incremental changes that allow you to adapt your lifestyle and relationship with food over time so that it is not overwhelming. Thank you!",
        "time": 1744923772,
        "translated": false
      },
